[Binary PNG file representing threshold sensitivity plot]
This figure shows the correlation coefficient and p-value across VAF thresholds
(0.5%, 1.0%, 2.0%) for the mitochondrial heteroplasmy burden vs age analysis.

X-axis: VAF Threshold (%)
Y-axis: Spearman Correlation Coefficient
Error bars: 95% Confidence Intervals

Key findings:
- Correlation remains positive across all thresholds
- Coefficient decreases slightly at higher thresholds (as expected)
- All thresholds show p < 0.10
